<title>USA: Apartment says unit buys 6.5 mln NHP shrs for Demeter Holdings.</title>
<headline>Apartment says unit buys 6.5 mln NHP shrs for Demeter Holdings.</headline>
<dateline>DENVER 1997-05-06</dateline>
<text>
<p>Apartment Investment and Management Co said Tuesday that one of its subsidiaries acquired about 6.5 million shares of NHP Inc common stock from Demeter Holdings Corp.</p>
<p>Demeter is an affiliate of Harvard Private Capital Group Inc and Capricorn Investors LP.</p>
<p>Apartment Investment said the NHP shares were acquired for $72.6 million in cash and about 2.1 million shares of AIMCO Class A Common Stock.</p>
<p>The shares acquired represent about 51 percent of NHP's outstanding shares of common stock.</p>
</text>
